&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;The source names are exposed once as text. The overlapping images and counter are hidden from assistive technology, avoiding a second announcement of the same source information.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This approach suits a static list. If users need to inspect or select individual sources, provide a visible details view with equivalent keyboard access. A tiny overlapped badge should not be the only way to reach an action.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Localize the source sentence and counter formatting for your product.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Reserve the column and contain the stack
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Apply these styles:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight css"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
